    FAIL  checkStudio is wired to path.id.unvalidated
    PASS  examples/sample-studio: zero findings from all four W-021 rule ids
    PASS  studio: no BLOCKING path.* finding (the insurance clause)

  The two PASS lines are behaviour 12's actual assertions and they passed
