CARRIED FORWARD FROM ROUND 2, UNCHANGED

  F2  `exit: 00` reads as a red. Non-blocking, one character, evidence.ts:191.
  F3  `opus.untracked` is blind to a gitignored opus — `git ls-files --others
      --exclude-standard` omits ignored files. Spec-compliant; a scope question
      for the rule's next revision.
  F5  Behaviour 12's assertion over `studio` relaxed to "no blocking path.*"
      after the level drop. Correct handling, documented in P-004.
  F6  The insurance clause was applied to both path.* rules though only
      `path.escapes.officina` ever fired. Brief-compliant; recorded so P-004's
      resolution re-promotes them separately.

  F4 is closed. 2412500 drops the GIT_CONFIG_* family atomically and `verify`
  now runs clean without an unset dance.

  Everything round 2 checked and passed still holds at b7edeb01: check.ts
  carries exactly the three permitted edits, package.json's `scripts.test`
